WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.440
I was waiting for Portland police to come

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:03.740
and they never came.

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:05.440
Then that's what opened my eyes

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:08.400
to what this group is actually doing.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.960
I watched 20 Antifa militants help my assault suspect

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.760
escape into an Antifa safe house

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:18.780
that is one block away from the ICE facility.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:22.480
And this safe house is where Antifa affiliated protestors

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:26.080
are conducting parliamentary operations.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:28.959
It's where they're arresting, they're showering,

00:00:28.959 --> 00:00:31.760
they're eating to continue this occupation.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.919
I have staked out this safe house

00:00:33.919 --> 00:00:36.259
and have observed shift changes.

00:00:36.259 --> 00:00:37.919
This group is highly organized.

00:00:37.919 --> 00:00:40.480
It is being funded through mutual aid groups

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:42.480
and they have no plans of stopping.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:45.279
Residents living across the ICE facility

00:00:45.279 --> 00:00:48.279
have been held hostage by Antifa.

00:00:48.279 --> 00:00:50.200
They're begging for federal intervention.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:52.000
The city refuses to help

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.759
and they want you, President Trump,

00:00:53.759 --> 00:00:56.639
to come in and restore law and order.

00:00:56.639 --> 00:00:58.560
I want to stress the importance

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:00.799
of taking this situation seriously

00:01:00.799 --> 00:01:03.619
because when I first started reporting on this occupation,

00:01:03.619 --> 00:01:05.639
I went undercover in Blacklock.

00:01:05.639 --> 00:01:07.440
I talked to these Antifa militants.

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:08.980
I lasted for about a month.

00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:11.879
They believe that ICE agents are the Nazi Gestapo

00:01:11.879 --> 00:01:13.040
who need to be killed.

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:14.239
They told me that directly.

00:01:14.239 --> 00:01:17.160
And I think that if this situation is not taken

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:18.519
as seriously as it is,

00:01:18.519 --> 00:01:20.879
it's just a matter of time before someone gets killed.

00:01:20.879 --> 00:01:23.080
And thank you for having me.

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:24.760
Thank you, Katie.

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:27.120
That's pretty incredible.

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:29.040
The only question nobody can answer is why.

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:30.040
Why are they doing this?

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:32.279
They're like insurrectionists.

00:01:32.279 --> 00:01:34.040
They're terrible people.

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:35.080
But you really wonder why.

00:01:35.080 --> 00:01:35.919
Why are they doing it?

00:01:35.919 --> 00:01:39.199
What are they gaining other than they're obviously paid?

00:01:39.199 --> 00:01:40.519
They're paid a lot of money.

00:01:40.519 --> 00:01:41.559
Go ahead, please.

00:01:41.559 --> 00:01:43.599
Mr. President, if I can answer that question,

00:01:43.599 --> 00:01:44.800
the reason why they're doing it

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:47.800
is because the same media that's sitting in this room with us

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:51.480
has declared all of us at this table Nazis and fascists.

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:53.440
And they've been doing this for years.

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:56.400
This is why Antifa feels emboldened to attack us.

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:58.279
Now, almost every single person at this table

00:01:58.279 --> 00:02:00.120
has been threatened with a steel bat.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.680
We've been assaulted. We've been harassed.

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:02.680
We've been threatened.

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:04.919
And that is in huge part to the media.

00:02:04.919 --> 00:02:07.599
So my message right now is for you guys.

00:02:07.599 --> 00:02:12.160
Because two years ago, or back in 2020, by the way,

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:14.240
I was censored for my reporting on Antifa

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:15.960
here in Washington, D.C.

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:17.759
You were talking about how safe it is.

00:02:17.759 --> 00:02:20.880
Now, Mr. President, it wasn't so safe back then.

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:23.360
Back in 2020, I watched as a father

00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:26.199
was being mobbed and surrounded by Antifa members

00:02:26.199 --> 00:02:28.520
as his terrified, crying children looked on

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:31.160
and the police here did nothing.

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:33.160
I watched as a woman had her hair violently

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:36.479
ripped out of her skull simply for waving an American flag

00:02:36.479 --> 00:02:39.080
on the streets of Washington, D.C.

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:41.240
And by the way, if you guys try to go and find

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:43.320
any of this footage, you won't find any of it

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:44.759
because Twitter deleted all of it

00:02:44.759 --> 00:02:47.039
because our president shared my reporting

00:02:47.039 --> 00:02:50.279
and they deleted my entire account immediately after.

00:02:50.279 --> 00:02:53.160
So now, if you want to know what happened in 2020,

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:55.360
all you're going to see is the media headlines that said

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.119
it was fiery but mostly peaceful.

00:02:57.119 --> 00:02:58.800
Thanks for that one, CNN.

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:01.720
The reality is that it was an extremely violent period

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:03.679
of time, and for the last 10 years,

00:03:03.679 --> 00:03:06.279
Antifa has been wrecking havoc on law-abiding

00:03:06.279 --> 00:03:09.600
and innocent American citizens, and it needs to end.

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:11.279
Now, I'm with Turning Point USA.

00:03:11.279 --> 00:03:13.520
It's an honor to be here, Mr. President.

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:16.279
Thank you guys so much, everybody in the administration,

00:03:16.279 --> 00:03:18.119
for giving us a seat at the table

00:03:18.119 --> 00:03:22.479
because the media has not only been demonizing us for so long,

00:03:22.479 --> 00:03:25.360
but immediately after the brutal assassination

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:27.240
of our founder, Charlie Kirk,

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:29.600
our Turning Point USA chapters have seen an uptick

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:32.839
in violence across the nation as Antifa chapters

00:03:32.839 --> 00:03:35.839
that are embedded in our universities go and target them.

